<section class="section section--sage">
  <div class="container prose" style="max-width:76ch">
    <h2>How we choose which markets to publish guides for</h2>
    <p>Every market page on this site is backed by trade data we could actually verify and cite — mostly WITS (World Bank) / UN Comtrade figures for India's exports by destination, supplemented by APEDA and MPEDA data where relevant. Where we couldn't verify a country's trade in a product, we don't publish a number for it.</p>
    <p>That means our market coverage reflects where India demonstrably ships, not where we'd like to claim a presence. If your country isn't listed, that doesn't mean we can't supply it — it means we haven't published a data-backed guide yet. <a href="/get-a-quote/">Send us your requirement</a> and we'll respond regardless of whether there's a page for your market.</p>
  </div>
</section>

